Operating directly behind the[ drill] bit, the iPZIG at-bit[ inclination] and gamma ray tool provides real-time measurements that reduce directional drilling risk in critical hole sections. The early indication of changes in lithology, delivered by the gamma ray log, helps to accurately land horizontal wells.
