I used the MI[ Bra]ids as my sound source for all 3 sequence patches and recorded them one by one(the[ viol]a bass patch is what is being played live). I used a[ lil] bit of a sine wave lfo for the flute/clarinet patches to give the[ trem]olo sound that those instruments naturally have. I also used some low pass filtering and fx processing with all 3 tracks.
Any[ways], hope you dig it!

