Mechwar[rior] 5: Mercenaries is that game. In development for some time, the latest look at it was released recently at Mech_Con. As you can see from the video, it’s looking[ darn] good. And fans should be pleased to learn that it’ll hold over many of the elements that have made the series so popular.
